OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMums of autistic girls create
OL,4,Aspecial app for parents
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo mothers who created an app to help
OL,7,Fparents of children with special needs
OL,8,Fconnect hope it means no one will feel
OL,9,Falone.
OL,11,FKate Dunn, whose daughter Ophelia has
OL,12,Fnon-verbal autism and ADHD, met the
OL,13,Fmother of Sophia, also diagnosed with
OL,14,Fautism, Nisha Warburton, in a carpark
OL,15,Foutside their specialist nursery in
OL,16,FBolton, Greater Manchester.
OL,18,FNisha said: "You go from feeling like
OL,19,Fthe only person who is dealing with
OL,20,Fsuch a situation to recognising that
OL,21,Factually a lot of people are."
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
