OL,3,GNEWSAMums of autistic girls create
OL,4,Aspecial app for parents
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn their free time, or while their
OL,7,Fchildren were asleep, the pair decided
OL,8,Fto make the app, called SEN2gether, to
OL,9,Fcreate a community as well as to share
OL,10,Finformation and tools for parents.
